      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We review the case of a patient who had wrist pain with synovial proliferation due to triangular fibrocartilage (TFC) thickening, whose pain was relieved by total TFC resection. This suggested that TFC thickening should be considered in the evaluation of patients with wrist pain."},
